    "detailed_description": "In this exciting game, players have the opportunity to earn experience points and level up as they progress through the levels. <br>As you level up, you'll earn ability points that can be used to upgrade your ball and unlock new abilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features:</h2>Arkanoid RPG mechanics<br><br>There are three ways to upgrade your ball: <br>Damage <br>Critical<br>Split<br><br>As you progress through the game, the blocks will increase in life every three levels, adding an extra layer of challenge. <br>The game has an idle arcade feel as you continue to level up and become more powerful. <br>Have fun and see how far you can go!<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "In this exciting game, players have the opportunity to earn experience points and level up as they progress through the levels. <br>As you level up, you'll earn ability points that can be used to upgrade your ball and unlock new abilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features:</h2>Arkanoid RPG mechanics<br><br>There are three ways to upgrade your ball: <br>Damage <br>Critical<br>Split<br><br>As you progress through the game, the blocks will increase in life every three levels, adding an extra layer of challenge. <br>The game has an idle arcade feel as you continue to level up and become more powerful. <br>Have fun and see how far you can go!<br><br>",
    "short_description": "Rampage Ball is a modern twist on a classic arcade game. It combines the gameplay of Arkanoid with RPG elements, allowing players to earn experience points and level up as they progress through the game. The game has an idle arcade feel as you progress through the levels and become more powerful.",
